You recover faster from poisons, diseases and wounds, reducing the duration of all such effects by [17%, 30%, 38%, 43%, 46% (TL1-5)].

Whenever your life falls below 50%, your life regeneration increases by [68, 87, 102, 115, 126 (TL1-5; CON 100)] for 8 turns ([539, 699, 819, 918, 1005 (TL1-5; CON 100)] total). This effect can only happen once every 15 turns.

The regeneration scales with your Constitution.
